Third-party components

This project does NOT vendor, link against, or redistribute TightVNC. It
speaks the RFB protocol to a separately installed TightVNC Server over the
network, and apps/relay/src/vnc-auth.ts and rfb-handshake.ts are clean-room
implementations written from RFC 6143 with no TightVNC, TigerVNC or RealVNC
source read or adapted. TightVNC is GPLv2 and is installed by the operator as
a prerequisite, not shipped here.

The browser-side viewer is @novnc/novnc, which is MPL-2.0.
